{"unit_id":"WhichWitchWin__dsh-power-button#card-zh","repo":"WhichWitchWin/dsh-power-button","commit":"c00fa18961ea894de3ac3f2e6514018c225ca493","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-power-button 是面向 Windows DSH 桌面版的界面插件，在 DSH 页面提供可拖动并能贴边收起的悬浮电源按钮，也在侧栏账户区域加入电源图标。点击后可选择重启或退出 DSH；检测到 agent 正在工作时会先要求确认。两个入口可以分别在插件配置页开关，配置保存在当前 profile。插件通过 Host 路由启动随包提供的 PowerShell 辅助程序来完成桌面进程操作，适合希望从 DSH 界面快速重启或退出桌面应用的 Windows 用户。需要 Windows 桌面环境及系统自带的 PowerShell、WMI；不需要 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2531-2544","lib/index.js:664-803","lib/restart-helper.ps1:125-187"]}
{"unit_id":"WhichWitchWin__dsh-power-button#card-en","repo":"WhichWitchWin/dsh-power-button","commit":"c00fa18961ea894de3ac3f2e6514018c225ca493","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-power-button adds a draggable floating button and sidebar power icon to DSH Desktop on Windows. Both open restart and quit actions, with confirmation when an agent is working. Each interface has its own settings switch. Requires Windows PowerShell and WMI; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2531-2544","lib/index.js:664-803","lib/restart-helper.ps1:125-187"]}
