{"unit_id":"WhichWitchWin__dsh-power-button#feature-1","repo":"WhichWitchWin/dsh-power-button","commit":"c00fa18961ea894de3ac3f2e6514018c225ca493","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-power-button 的功能「悬浮电源菜单」：在 DSH 页面显示可拖动的圆形按钮，拖到窗口左右边缘后收成细条，鼠标移上去重新展开；点击可选择重启或退出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1944-1979","lib/client.js:1999-2038"]}
{"unit_id":"WhichWitchWin__dsh-power-button#feature-2","repo":"WhichWitchWin/dsh-power-button","commit":"c00fa18961ea894de3ac3f2e6514018c225ca493","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-power-button 的功能「侧栏电源入口」：在侧栏底部账户区域头像旁加入电源图标，点击后打开同一重启和退出菜单。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2531-2544"]}
